==English==
{{was wotd|2011|October|2}}

===Etymology===
Possibly from a {{blend|en|splash|surge|nocap=1}}, originally US.<ref>{{R:Etymonline}}</ref><ref>{{R:MWO}}</ref> According to the OED, {{onom|en|nocap=1}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=v}}</ref><ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=n}}</ref>

